        "en": "Clients frequently commend the veterinary surgeons and reception staff on Prince of Wales Road for their welcoming approach and attentive consultations. Pet owners describe feeling supported during both routine wellness checks and complex medical appointments, noting that staff listen carefully and explain treatment options clearly."
      }
