      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight that dogs and cats receive calm and thoughtful care throughout examinations and routine procedures. Multiple reviewers with anxious or temperamental pets mention that the clinical team takes extra time to soothe them, ensuring that animals remain comfortable and settled during clinical visits."
      }
    },
