      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple pet owners appreciate that the practice discusses cost-effective options, offers manageable health plans, and avoids recommending unnecessary medical procedures. However, one client noted that overall veterinary fees felt very expensive, reflecting varying impressions of routine treatment pricing."
      }
